# Preserve the byte identity of frozen scientific inputs and Python engines;
# their SHA256 values are part of the provenance model. Linux entry-point
# scripts alone are normalized to LF so Bash/Slurm never see CRLF tokens.
* -text whitespace=-trailing-space
*.sh text eol=lf whitespace
*.slurm text eol=lf whitespace
.gitattributes text eol=lf whitespace
